---
name: shorts-director
version: 0.1.0
description: Discover and rank short-form clips from evidence-bound beats.
inputs:
  - beats: array of { beat_id, evidence_ref }
  - hook_strength: float
  - standalone_context: float
  - payoff: float
  - visual_support: float
  - boundary_confidence: float
  - duplication_penalty: float
  - recorded: bool
outputs:
  - candidates: array of ranked ShortCandidate
  - rationale: string
  - exclusion_reasons: array of string
invariants:
  - never fabricate hook text; recorded must be true
  - never invent timestamps; the caller compiles beats into ranges
  - diversity-filter overlapping candidates
  - excluded candidates sorted last